        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sophia Petrillo, Bea Arthur, Estelle Getty, Sylvester Stallone\n- Roles: Dorothy Zbornak\n- Shows and Films: The Golden Girls, The Golden Palace, Empty Nest, Stop! Or My Mom Will Shoot\n- Awards: Emmy, Golden Globe\n\nFacts:\n- Bea Arthur, born Bernice Frankel on May 13, 1922, was an American actress, comedian, singer, and animal rights activist.\n- Estelle Getty was best known for playing Sophia Petrillo on The Golden Girls from 1985 to 1992, and that role won her an Emmy and a Golden Globe.\n- Estelle Getty played Sophia Petrillo on The Golden Palace from 1992 to 1993.\n- Stop! Or My Mom Will Shoot stars Sylvester Stallone and Estelle Getty.\n- Estelle Getty played Sophia Petrillo on Empty Nest from 1993 to 1995.\n- Bea Arthur played Dorothy Zbornak, the daughter of Sophia Petrillo, and Bea Arthur was in real life one year older than Estelle Getty.",
